   <taskbody>  <context>
    <p>The <b>Clauses</b> section of the Document Panel lists all smart clauses in the agreement document. </p><p>Use the Document Panel to take the following actions on clauses:</p><ul>
         <li>
            <xref href="#workingwithclausesviewclause">Navigate to a clause in the document.</xref>
         </li>
         <li>
            <xref href="#workingwithclausesrejectclause">Reject changes to a clause.</xref>
         </li>
         <li>
            <xref href="#workingwithclausesdeleteclause">Mark a clause for deletion.</xref>
         </li>
         <li>
            <xref href="#workingwithclausesunmarkclause">Unmark a clause.</xref>
         </li>
      </ul>
  </context></taskbody>
